fracture.everstead.rending=Rending
fracture.everstead.rending.desc=Hits deal more damage but wear the weapon faster
fracture.everstead.phase=Phase
fracture.everstead.phase.desc=Sometimes dodges damage completely, briefly glitching your view
fracture.everstead.echoing=Echoing
fracture.everstead.echoing.desc=Mined blocks sometimes drop twice, but the tool can fail to break them
fracture.everstead.splinter=Splinter
fracture.everstead.splinter.desc=Hits sometimes send a shard that strikes the enemy again
fracture.everstead.afterimage=Afterimage
fracture.everstead.afterimage.desc=Getting hit rarely releases a pulse that pushes nearby entities away
fracture.everstead.fault_line=Fault Line
fracture.everstead.fault_line.desc=Mining sometimes breaks more blocks in a line behind the mined one
fracture.everstead.resonance=Resonance
fracture.everstead.resonance.desc=Every fourth hit in a row on the same enemy releases a burst
fracture.everstead.undertow=Undertow
fracture.everstead.undertow.desc=Hits sometimes pull the enemy toward you instead of knocking it back
fracture.everstead.shatterpoint=Shatterpoint
fracture.everstead.shatterpoint.desc=A rare hit deals double damage
fracture.everstead.seam=Seam
fracture.everstead.seam.desc=Mining an ore usually breaks every connected ore of the same type
fracture.everstead.refraction=Refraction
fracture.everstead.refraction.desc=Projectiles that hit you sometimes bounce back at the shooter
fracture.everstead.overflow=Overflow
fracture.everstead.overflow.desc=Mined blocks sometimes drop experience
fracture.everstead.tear=Tear
fracture.everstead.tear.desc=Kills rarely leave a small tear that pulls nearby items to you
fracture.everstead.ricochet=Ricochet
fracture.everstead.ricochet.desc=Arrows that hit a block sometimes bounce toward the nearest enemy
fracture.everstead.recall=Recall
fracture.everstead.recall.desc=Arrows that miss usually fly back to you
fracture.everstead.coalesce=Coalesce
fracture.everstead.coalesce.desc=Picked up experience repairs the item
fracture.everstead.tempered=Tempered
fracture.everstead.tempered.desc=Durability loss is sometimes ignored
